# Independent review — four-case response-review draft

Reviewed the complete `response-review-pack-draft.md` against the complete four existing source files listed below. This is a source and editorial review of documentation only. No new model responses, tests, runtime edits, browser actions, provider calls or participant observations were produced. No full-book, original-script or scan reading is claimed.

## Result

**No blocker or required correction found.** The four proposed fictional text-conversation cases faithfully separate requested private writing, explicit refusal of exercises/questions/disclosure, sparse regret without established fault, and disclosed snapping with an explicit request for apology help. The cases and editorial questions remain drafts for Carl's review. The pack does not approve the candidate policy or authorize an evaluation run.

